    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Persistent hypoglycemia with inappropriate insulin secretion plus identification of activating GCK mutation and exclusion of other hyperinsulinism causes",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis; biochemical testing during hypoglycemia is critical."
